    <b>Forum Streamlining</b><br>
    <font size=1><b>Date:</b> Friday, February 08 @ 15:38:27 EST<br><b>Topic:</b> SiteUpdates<br><br>
    </center><font size=2>
    In an effort to decrease loading time of the forums and make navigation easier, a few changes to the forum layout have been made.<br /><br />Firstly, the Quest and Hunters Domain forums have been merged into one: The Adventurer's Domain. This forum is for the discussion of Quests, Hunting Spots, and Equipment in the world of Norrath.<br /><br />Secondly, the Polls forum has been deleted. Since the new site opened up it has ended any need by the staff for such a forum, as the site has a built in fully functional survey program.<br /><br />We hope these modifications will make it easier to load and surf our forums. <br><br>
